      "section": "4.0.1 图线线宽",
      "page": 19,
      "raw_text": "图线的基本线宽b，宜从1.4mm、1.0mm、0.7mm、0.5mm线宽系列中选取。",
      "extracted_facts": {
        "basic_line_widths_mm": [1.4, 1.0, 0.7, 0.5]
